  ('N4.2-09', 'lesson', null, false, 'national', 'N4', 'N4.2', 'Content Outlines 01/15/2025 (#092901) [verify]', 'PRIN', 'mcq', 3, 'application', 'A developer''s single loan covers 30 lots. As each lot sells, the developer pays a set amount to free that lot from the loan. The loan is a:', '["Wraparound loan","Open-end loan","Blanket loan with a release clause","Package loan"]'::jsonb, '2'::jsonb, 'One loan on many parcels is a blanket loan; the release clause frees lots as they sell.', '["A wraparound includes an existing loan.","An open-end loan allows extra advances.","","A package loan includes personal property."]'::jsonb, 'Blanket covers many.', null, '[]'::jsonb, null, 'blanket-release-clause', 'unverified'),
