  ('N6.1-09', 'lesson', null, false, 'national', 'N6', 'N6.1', 'Content Outlines 01/15/2025 (#092901) [verify]', 'LAW', 'mcq', 2, 'recall', 'An inspector notes possible foundation movement. The buyer''s agent should recommend:', '["Ignoring it, since the inspector isn''t sure","That the seller paint over cracks","Closing quickly before it worsens","A structural engineer''s evaluation"]'::jsonb, '3'::jsonb, 'Specialists evaluate issues beyond a general inspection.', '["Uncertain findings call for more investigation.","Concealing defects is misrepresentation.","Rushing past a red flag hurts the client.",""]'::jsonb, 'Red flag? Call the specialist.', null, '[]'::jsonb, null, 'specialist-inspections', 'unverified'),
